  {
   "texts": [
    {
     "evidences": [
      {
       "evidenceCode": "ECO:0000255",
       "source": "HAMAP-Rule",
       "id": "MF_03016"
      }
     ],
     "value": "Acylated. Acylation may be a prerequisite for conversion of the monomeric 37 kDa laminin receptor precursor (37LRP) to the mature dimeric 67 kDa laminin receptor (67LR), and may provide a mechanism for membrane association"
    }
   ],
   "commentType": "PTM"
  },
  {
   "texts": [
    {
     "evidences": [
      {
       "evidenceCode": "ECO:0000255",
       "source": "HAMAP-Rule",
       "id": "MF_03016"
      }
     ],
     "value": "Cleaved by stromelysin-3 (ST3) at the cell surface. Cleavage by stromelysin-3 may be a mechanism to alter cell-extracellular matrix interactions"
    }
   ],
   "commentType": "PTM"
  },
  {
